WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.621
SERSI
We're Eternals.

00:00:02.029 --> 00:00:03.511
For 7,000 years

00:00:03.646 --> 00:00:05.353
we've protected humans
from the Deviants.

00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:08.529
DANE WHITMAN
Why didn't you guys help fight Thanos?

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.146
Or any war or all the other terrible
things throughout history.

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:13.493
SERSI
We were instructed not to interfere...

00:00:14.593 --> 00:00:15.667
Until now.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:18.893
IKARIS
You hear that?

00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:20.233
Eternals assemble.

00:00:24.346 --> 00:00:25.346
KINGO
Hi!

00:00:25.397 --> 00:00:26.410
THENA
Hello.

00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:27.562
KINGO
Hey who's your gardener?

00:00:34.813 --> 00:00:36.565
AJAK
This planet and these people

00:00:36.616 --> 00:00:38.476
 have changed all of us.

00:00:40.421 --> 00:00:41.416
THENA
When you love something..

00:00:42.273 --> 00:00:43.664
You protect it.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.054
SERSI
For eternity.

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:51.121
JACK
What's your super power?

00:00:52.082 --> 00:00:53.504
PHASTOS
You know that your babysitting privileges

00:00:53.555 --> 00:00:54.582
are completely revoked.

